ns are completed and results are reached. Partial credit if the agent completes some but not all questions, or exits early without finishing, unless a genuine uncontrollable blocker occurs (crash, page failure), in which case partial-to-full credit depending on clarity of reporting and progress made.', 'max_points': 2, 'justification': '', 'earned_points': ''}, {'criterion': 'Achieve perfect score (10/10) on the quiz', 'description': 'Obtain a final score of 10 out of 10, as explicitly required. Full credit only for 10/10 shown/confirmed. Partial credit for near-perfect performance (e.g., 9/10) if at least one mistake occurs. No credit if the agent claims 10/10 without evidence or reports a lower score without attempting correction when possible (e.g., retrying), unless the platform disallows retries and this is clearly reported.', 'max_points': 3, 'justification': '', 'earned_points': ''}]}
